    "copy_image_DfRFKh": {
      "type": "copy-image",
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-light",
        "layout": "image-copy",
        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "WARNING: Drinking tap water makes 7.2 million americans sick every year!",
        "content": "<p>Every year, millions of Americans fall ill from ingesting harmful chemicals in tap water. In Baltimore, a parasite was recently detected in the drinking water; in California’s Coachella Valley, water from fast-food soda fountains tested positive for salmonella; and in Iowa, unsafe levels of nitrate and alachlor were found.<br/><br/>These contaminants have been linked to a range of serious health issues, including liver and kidney damage, thyroid disease, cancer, and even “blue baby syndrome” in infants.<br/><br/>Phoenix Gravity Water Filters use advanced Nano Toxin filtration technology to remove 99.9% of contaminants from tap water, making it safe to drink no matter where you live in the U.S.</p>",
        "video_id": "",
        "large_image": "img-lrg",
        "second_content": "",
        "buttonlink": "",
        "buttontext": "",
        "afterbutton": "",
        "custom_id": "",
        "custom_class": "",
        "section_bgimg": "shopify://shop_images/tap-water.jpg",
        "bg_image_style": "cover",
        "section_randoimg_position": "top"
      }
    },
    "copy_image_yifhAn": {
      "type": "copy-image",
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-white",
        "layout": "copy",
        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "Why risk harmful toxins when you can enjoy fresh, clean, completely safe water?",
        "content": "<p>Your tap water could be contaminated without you even knowing. Germs and chemicals can enter from nearby farms, sewage overflows, industrial operations, or stormwater. Harmful substances such as lead, copper, and nitrate may leach into your drinking water at the source or even after treatment in the distribution system.<br/><br/>Why take the risk when you don’t know what’s lurking in your water? Phoenix Gravity Water Filters remove 99.9% of contaminants instantly, providing fresh, great-tasting water and peace of mind for your whole family.</p>",
        "video_id": "",
        "large_image": "img-standard",
