          "settings": {
            "heading": "Save A Fortune On Bottles Or A Whole-Home System",
            "copy": "<p>Why spend $1,000s on bottled water or buy an expensive in-home system when you can enjoy safe, delicious water for a fraction of the cost?</p>",
