          "settings": {
            "heading": "Lightweight And Easy To Move Or Carry Around",
            "copy": "<p>Phoenix Water Filters are lightweight and portable – you can carry them from home, to work, to camping trips and back!</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-scales_bbf132a3-2ee0-4790-b250-ec80e2bd5d7f.svg",
            "video_id": ""
          }
        },
        "text_6fa9wW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Built To Last Up To 10 Years Or More",
            "copy": "<p>Made from quality ASI 304 Grade Stainless Steel, Phoenix Gravity Water Filters are backed by a 10-year warranty to give you added peace of mind!</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-time_22302494-3a88-4cf5-b70b-b40949aed71d.svg",
            "video_id": ""
          }
        },
        "text_bA9cTL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Backed By 50+ Years Of Experience",
            "copy": "<p>We’ve been manufacturing industry-leading water filters for decades, and all of our products are backed by thousands of hours of research and development!</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-approval.svg",
            "video_id": ""
          }
        },
        "text_b79geA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Enjoy Delicious-Tasting Water Every Day",
            "copy": "<p>Sick of water that tastes gross, or smells like chlorine and other chemicals? Enjoy pure water that’s so delicious you’ll never want to drink anything else!</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-glass_902848fa-b2f9-4cf7-ac7c-231521a3b76b.svg",
            "video_id": ""
          }
        }
